From f728117c76b582b0c4116b84c208ce97d422e9b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 12:36:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(energy-grid): merge standalone EGP v1.1.0 into monorepo

Bring PROFINET RT/RTA and OPC UA port coverage, TcpClient disposal,
and host:port finding deduplication from Energy-Grid-Protector into
the unified ICS OT Protector config and scanners.
---
 CHANGELOG.md                             |  9 ++++++
 README.md                                |  2 +-
 config/sectors/energy-grid.json          | 20 +++++++++++-
 config/sectors/energy-grid.yaml          | 14 ++++++++-
 docs/sectors/energy-grid/threat-model.md |  2 +-
 scanners/energy-grid/README.md           |  4 +--
 scanners/energy-grid/bash/EGP.sh         | 19 +++++++----
 scanners/energy-grid/powershell/EGP.ps1  | 40 +++++++++++++++---------
 8 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index f5b9515..323780d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -4,6 +4,15 @@ This project follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) and intends
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [4.1.2] - 2026-08-23
+
+### Added
+- **EGP v1.1.0 port coverage** — PROFINET RT/RTA (34962, 34963) and OPC UA (4840) merged from standalone Energy-Grid-Protector into `config/sectors/energy-grid.yaml`
+
+### Fixed
+- **EGP — finding deduplication** — host:port reported once across CVE, remote-access, and ICS checks (parity with standalone v1.1.0)
+- **EGP PowerShell — socket cleanup** — `Test-TcpPort` now disposes the `TcpClient` in a `finally` block (parity with standalone v1.1.0)
+
 ## [4.1.1] - 2026-08-19
 
 ### Added
